        "description": "Increases basic stats of [00D5FF]Applicable Allies[-] by [FFAE00]5%[-] for [FFAE00]each[-] one participating in battle.\\n[i][C0C0C0]※Applicable Allies: Humans, Fairies, [The Seven Deadly Sins][/i][-]\\n\\nThe hero gains the [00D5FF]Hunter[-] effect and inflicts [00D5FF]Hunter's Mark[-] on all enemies at the start of the battle.\\n[i][C0C0C0]※Hunter: Increases Lifesteal by [FFAE00]1%[-] up to a maximum of [FFAE00]30%[-] for every [FFAE00]3%[-] of diminished HP when using a skill. Increases damage dealt with all-target attack skills by [FFAE00]50%[-].\\n※Hunter's Mark: All stats [FFAE00]-10%[-] (resets upon taking damage).[/i][-]\\n\\nFor [FFAE00]each[-] [00D5FF]Extort[-] effect on enemies, the hero's Crit Damage increases by [FFAE00]70%[-] and HP by [FFAE00]10%[-].\\n\\nIf the hero does not take damage during the enemy's turn, [00D5FF]Hunter's Mark[-] is applied on all enemies at the start of the allies' turn. [FFAE00](3 times)[-]\\n\\nThe hero's basic stats increase by [FFAE00]5%[-] up to a maximum of [FFAE00]15%[-] for [FFAE00]each[-] [00D5FF]Hunter's Mark[-] on enemies.",
